<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Jones Group 1996 pretax loss 1.02 mln punt.</title>
<headline>Jones Group 1996 pretax loss 1.02 mln punt.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.6 loss	vs 1.2  profit</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.02 loss     vs 0.11 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   98.63	   vs 86.69</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name - Jones Group Plc is an Irish engineering and shipping company.</p>
<p>The company said no dividend payment in respect of 1996 was being proposed.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
